<div class="faction-sheet">
    <div class="faction-sheet-header">
        {% if faction.logo %}
        <div class="faction-logo">
            <img src="{{ faction.logo }}" alt="Logo {{ faction.name }}" class="img-fluid">
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <h2>{{ faction.name }}</h2>
        <div class="faction-sheet-badges">
            {% if faction.alignment %}
                <span class="faction-badge alignment-{{ faction.alignment }}">
                    {% if faction.alignment == 'hero' %}Super-héros
                    {% elseif faction.alignment == 'villain' %}Super-vilain
                    {% elseif faction.alignment == 'antihero' %}Anti-héros
                    {% elseif faction.alignment == 'vigilante' %}Vigilante
                    {% elseif faction.alignment == 'neutral' %}Neutre
                    {% else %}Autre{% endif %}
                </span>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if faction.scope %}
                <span class="faction-badge">
                    {% if faction.scope == 'galaxy' %}Portée galactique
                    {% elseif faction.scope == 'international' %}Portée internationale
                    {% elseif faction.scope == 'national' %}Portée nationale
                    {% elseif faction.scope == 'regional' %}Portée régionale
                    {% elseif faction.scope == 'local' %}Portée locale
                    {% endif %}
                </span>
            {% endif %}
            
            <span class="faction-badge status-{{ faction.status }}">
                {{ faction.status == 'open' ? 'Ouvert aux recrutements' : 'Fermé aux recrutements' }}
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="faction-sheet-info">
        <p><strong>Univers :</strong> {{ faction.universe.name }}</p>
        <p><strong>Fondateur :</strong> {{ faction.founder.pseudo }}</p>
        {% if faction.headquarters %}
            <p><strong>Quartier général :</strong> {{ faction.headquarters.name }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <p><strong>Membres :</strong> {{ faction.characters|length }} personnage(s){% if faction.npcs|length > 0 %} et {{ faction.npcs|length }} PNJ(s){% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    
    {% if faction.description %}
        <div class="faction-sheet-section">
            <h3>Description</h3>
            <div class="faction-sheet-content">
                {{ faction.description|raw }}
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    
    {% if faction.objectives %}
        <div class="faction-sheet-section">
            <h3>Objectifs</h3>
            <div class="faction-sheet-content">
                {{ faction.objectives|raw }}
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    
    {% if faction.headquartersDescription %}
        <div class="faction-sheet-section">
            <h3>Quartier général</h3>
            <div class="faction-sheet-content">
                {{ faction.headquartersDescription|raw }}
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    
    <div class="faction-sheet-footer">
        <p>Cette fiche a été générée automatiquement et représente l'état actuel de la faction.</p>
        <p>Pour plus d'informations ou pour rejoindre la faction, 
        {% if faction.id is defined and faction.id is not null and faction.slug is defined and faction.slug is not null %}
            <a href="{{ path('app_faction_show', {'universeSlug': faction.universe.slug, 'factionSlug': faction.slug}) }}">consultez la page de la faction</a>.
        {% else %}
            <span>consultez la page de la faction</span>.
        {% endif %}
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
